Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|App Manager|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View Independent Modules Is Not Nested Within Itself
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|AppManagerUsecase#ViewIndependentModulesIsNotNestedWithinItself|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|App Manager|
	And AppManager select App CP
		|appName|Independent Modules|
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	Then AppManager view No App CP
		|appName|Independent Modules|